    "user_request_original": "Design a 29-layer planar dielectric filter stack on Fused Silica substrate with Air incident medium. Materials are Ta2O5 (Gao) (high index) and SiO2 (Lemarchand) (low index). Layer sequence from incident side: layer 0 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 1 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 2 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 3 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 4 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 5 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 6 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 7 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 8 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 9 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 10 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 11 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 12 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 13 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 14 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 15 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 16 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 17 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 18 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 19 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 20 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 21 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 22 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 23 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 24 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 25 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 26 Ta2O5 (Gao), layer 27 SiO2 (Lemarchand), layer 28 Ta2O5 (Gao). Layers 0-8 and 20-28 are fixed mirror layers: Ta2O5 (Gao) layers at 185 nm, SiO2 (Lemarchand) layers at 267 nm. Layers 9-19 (11 cavity layers) are optimizable with bounds 225-275 nm. Optimize for maximum mean transmittance at 1550 nm (single wavelength), minimum mean transmittance at 1400-1500 nm band, minimum mean transmittance at 1600-1700 nm band. Use coherent transfer-matrix method solver at normal incidence. Optimizer: bounded L-BFGS with line-search backtracking, step-size limit 0.05. Total layers: 29.",
